crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33515e3edc62b02b982e80ff4239eb1b, https://si.imgix.net/d5069b22/uploads/origins/5e7e2af2-3499-420d-908c-6983c13579ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58afd9c310d3fc292fd2946f9d934bc6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5069b22/uploads/origins/5e7e2af2-3499-420d-908c-6983c13579ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13876e59a19634bef114f41647356032 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Love the artwork you create! I would like to request some art from you!!\n\nCould you draw my gunslinger boy? https://imgur.com/a/i893n42\n\nI recently made a new outfit for him, so I'd appreciate it if you can draw him in this\nClothing ref: https://imgur.com/a/k3u1ZEq\n\nI'd appreciate it if you can draw a full-body. Any pose/face expression is fine!!\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xemimal_mukuro/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f6e31b2a/uploads/origins/87f5daee-1ccc-4091-85a5-2be5370b05ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=414dc665f273c27a549a19e2f7654445", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f6e31b2a/uploads/origins/87f5daee-1ccc-4091-85a5-2be5370b05ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=414dc665f273c27a549a19e2f7654445, https://si.imgix.net/f6e31b2a/uploads/origins/87f5daee-1ccc-4091-85a5-2be5370b05ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f84659361e65584373f1cb61e9d96e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f6e31b2a/uploads/origins/87f5daee-1ccc-4091-85a5-2be5370b05ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79b06796920bd95a8129fb07dbafd619 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I  would like for you to draw this character! You may choose the pose!\nThis character is a tomboy delinquent with sharp teeth, and the inside of her mouth and tongue is black!\n\nhtt